==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

